{
  "file_id": "3539",
  "text_count": 235,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "I thought maybe we should get some\nfood.",
      "_offset": 3803,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Oh, good! I'm starving!",
      "_offset": 3844,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "I'm stuck using a twig for bait.\nI'm hoping fish will mistake it\nfor a worm.",
      "_offset": 3868,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Ah! Something's pulling on it!",
      "_offset": 3945,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Gh...It's heavy...",
      "_offset": 3976,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Help!",
      "_offset": 3995,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Ghhhhhhhh!!",
      "_offset": 4001,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Joe?!",
      "_offset": 4013,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "And Gomamon!",
      "_offset": 4019,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "U-ughhhhhh...",
      "_offset": 4032,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "What on earth happened?!",
      "_offset": 4046,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Well...",
      "_offset": 4071,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "This is why I *said* I didn't want\nto go to camp.",
      "_offset": 4079,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "You can tell me that all you want,\nbut I can't do much about it.",
      "_offset": 4129,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Who else do I say it to, then?\nWe're the only ones here!",
      "_offset": 4194,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Yeah, but if we're gonna drift\naround, we should have a bit more\noptimism about it.",
      "_offset": 4251,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "How are we supposed to have a bit\nmore optimism?!\n...Ah...ughhhh...",
      "_offset": 4335,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Can't really call this\nseasickness. Maybe bedsickness?",
      "_offset": 4403,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "What does seasickness have to do\nwith optimism...Hm? A box!",
      "_offset": 4458,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "You're right!",
      "_offset": 4518,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Maybe it's got something to eat!\nLike canned food, or rations.",
      "_offset": 4532,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Grrrrooooooooh!!",
      "_offset": 4595,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Gyaaaaaaaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 4612,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Ogremon?!",
      "_offset": 4628,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Sorry, I'm not food! I'm gonna\nbeat you, Chosen Children!",
      "_offset": 4638,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Nghhhaaaaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 4696,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Nghhhaaaaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 4712,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Nghhhaaaaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 4728,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Whoaaaaa!",
      "_offset": 4744,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "We can't run away! All this bed\nshaking is making me sick!",
      "_offset": 4754,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Attacking at a time like this?\nYou're playing dirty!",
      "_offset": 4813,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Shut up! Take this!\nPuño Imperial!",
      "_offset": 4866,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Waaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 4906,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Joooooooooooooou!",
      "_offset": 4920,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "We managed to get away...and when\nI thought it was all over, your\nfishing line appeared.",
      "_offset": 4938,
      "_length": 88,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "We didn't catch any fish, but I'm\nglad it worked out.",
      "_offset": 5027,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "So, I have a favor to ask.",
      "_offset": 5081,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "What?",
      "_offset": 5108,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "It's about Joe. He's completely\nlost his nerve.",
      "_offset": 5114,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "He's never been very confident.",
      "_offset": 5162,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "So, what should we do?",
      "_offset": 5194,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "We can't have an adventure like\nthis, so let's make him leader to\ngive him some confidence.",
      "_offset": 5217,
      "_length": 91,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Gomamon...Sora? Piyomon? Where is\neveryone?",
      "_offset": 5309,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "We just got here, too.",
      "_offset": 5353,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "I see.",
      "_offset": 5376,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "That's why we're making you leader\nfrom now on!",
      "_offset": 5383,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Ehhh?",
      "_offset": 5431,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Ehhh?",
      "_offset": 5437,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Please!",
      "_offset": 5443,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Please!",
      "_offset": 5451,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "W-wait a minute!",
      "_offset": 5459,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "You're the only one who can do it,\nJoe!",
      "_offset": 5476,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Okay! I'll be the leader!",
      "_offset": 5516,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Is that to celebrate me becoming\nleader?",
      "_offset": 5542,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "I don't think so.",
      "_offset": 5583,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "The fog's clearing up!",
      "_offset": 5601,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "The fog's clearing up!",
      "_offset": 5624,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "There's a church over there!",
      "_offset": 5647,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Maybe this time there'll be humans\ninside!",
      "_offset": 5676,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Let's go check it out!",
      "_offset": 5719,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Wait! Joe is the leader! What\nshould we do, Leader?",
      "_offset": 5742,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "A-ah, but...well...uh...we'll\nall...yeah, let's go!",
      "_offset": 5794,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Okay! Maybe we'll finally see\nother humans in that church!",
      "_offset": 5846,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "You're still saying that. It'd be\nconvenient if there were, but...",
      "_offset": 5905,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "*I'm* the leader here!",
      "_offset": 5972,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Yeah, but...",
      "_offset": 5995,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Let's go!!",
      "_offset": 6008,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "What's with the sudden pride?",
      "_offset": 6019,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "He's become more of a leader!",
      "_offset": 6049,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Yeah, but...",
      "_offset": 6079,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Yeah, but...",
      "_offset": 6092,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "What should we do?",
      "_offset": 6108,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "The leader should go look!",
      "_offset": 6127,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Whaaaaat?!",
      "_offset": 6154,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Go, Leader!",
      "_offset": 6165,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Okay...",
      "_offset": 6177,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "There really *are* people in\nthere!",
      "_offset": 6185,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "No way!",
      "_offset": 6221,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "What are they doing?",
      "_offset": 6232,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Looks kind of fun!",
      "_offset": 6253,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Excuse me, what kind of dance is\nthis?",
      "_offset": 6272,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "This is a carnival where we make\nofferings to the Great Bakemon!",
      "_offset": 6311,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "What's the Great Bakemon?",
      "_offset": 6376,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "The Great Bakemon is the Great\nBakemon!",
      "_offset": 6402,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Huh...",
      "_offset": 6442,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Would you also like to leave\nofferings to the Great Bakemon?",
      "_offset": 6449,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "The Great Bakemon...",
      "_offset": 6510,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "I know about Bakemon! They're\nghost Digimon who live in the\nOverdell Graveyard, but...",
      "_offset": 6531,
      "_length": 86,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "...They're not exactly a Digimon\nyou'd want to leave offerings to.",
      "_offset": 6618,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "God does not tolerate those who\nspeak ill of the Great Bakemon!",
      "_offset": 6685,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Sorry.",
      "_offset": 6749,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "We are lucky to have guests come\non our day of carnival.",
      "_offset": 6756,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "We're lucky to have ended up on\nthis island!",
      "_offset": 6813,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Joe, there's something really\nsuspicious about these people.",
      "_offset": 6858,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "There's nothing suspicious, miss.",
      "_offset": 6919,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Gyah! Sorry.",
      "_offset": 6953,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "You've got good hearing.",
      "_offset": 6966,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Have any other children besides us\ncome here?",
      "_offset": 6991,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Other children? Unfortunately, no.",
      "_offset": 7037,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "I see. I wonder where everyone\nelse is...",
      "_offset": 7072,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "More importantly, want to come\ndance for the Great Bakemon with\nus?",
      "_offset": 7114,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "No thanks, we'll pass.",
      "_offset": 7182,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "We've come from Tokyo, and we need\nto get back.",
      "_offset": 7205,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "That seems like a problem. Please\ndo stay in this church as long as\nyou like.",
      "_offset": 7253,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "No, I mean we *want* to get back!",
      "_offset": 7331,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Please help yourself here!",
      "_offset": 7365,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Looks like we're not going to get\nanywhere...",
      "_offset": 7392,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "That's not good...",
      "_offset": 7438,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "Luckily, we have obtained our\nofferings for today.",
      "_offset": 7457,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Where's the offering? I can't see\nit.",
      "_offset": 7508,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "We have it.",
      "_offset": 7546,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "Eh? Where?",
      "_offset": 7558,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Well...",
      "_offset": 7569,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "W-well...?",
      "_offset": 7577,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "...You!",
      "_offset": 7588,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "...You!",
      "_offset": 7596,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "english": "...You!",
      "_offset": 7604,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "english": "Gyaaaaaaaaaaah!!",
      "_offset": 7612,
